<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, before time had begun,</l><l>We were marked and called out by You.</l><l>We had no choice, we were trapped by You, Lord;</l><l>We had no place we could run.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Some of my friends are so free.</l><l>Who could I blame, Lord, but Thee?</l><l>I cannot do all the things that they do</l><l>Because You set me apart.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, I’m realizing that</l><l>Loving You’s a tender trap.</l><l>Since You have kissed me, my heart has melted;</l><l>All my resistance has cracked.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
